{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "leaf_veins",
  "description": "dark branching veins in a frame of green leaves: each branch of a dendrite a crisp near-black vein with a short soft shadow, wrapped in a pale-lime leaf blade, fine dark side veins (field lines) running off it at an angle and cut into leaf-shaped bands, every band domed by a soft light, deep green shadow where the leaves leave off",
  "reference": {
    "image": "commons_Fractal_Art_Series__2814465834074_29.jpg",
    "folder": "fractal-drive-sync/style-refs",
    "made_with": "a Wikimedia Commons 'Fractal Art Series' picture, 2560x1440; its maker's method is not stated (the dense leaf tile reads as a flame or IFS render)"
  },
  "suggested_colormap": "leaf_veins",
  "reuses": [
    "the palette layer by rank on the distance estimate, inverted: pale near the set, the map's dark end far from it, so each dendrite wears a leaf blade and the gaps between are shadow",
    "field_lines' lines channel (radius 2, twist 1, divide 2) as two period sheets multiplied dark: side veins and finer veinlets running off every branch at an angle",
    "the lines channel's step by rank, inverted, as an overlay: a tone per escape band, so the band seams cut the blades into leaf shapes",
    "a light on the smooth count at one period a step (slope only): each band domed as a leaf",
    "glow_filaments' falloff glows on de, painted dark instead of light: a soft shadow and a crisp hairline vein along every branch",
    "the tone pass, at the reference's median and p10"
  ],
